  "description": "CODEARAMBH 2.0 is a 24-hour offline hackathon organized by the Research Radiance Team, Department of Computer Science & Engineering, Hi-Tech Institute of Engineering & Technology (HIET), Ghaziabad , with support from the Institution’s Innovation Council (IIC) and Sunstone . The hackathon welcomes students from HIET as well as participants from other colleges/institutions to collaborate, innovate, and build impactful technology solutions in a competitive and engaging environment. Official WhatsApp Group: Join the official WhatsApp group for registration updates, announcements, important instructions and event communication : https://chat.whatsapp.com/HR09HaxGTWmBiOKdAvwsg4 PPT TEMPLATE: https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1EOs74iybBU2cr2qRKrD6VKfIdGxydTDZ/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=110001097703440686415&rtpof=true&sd=true Event Highlights: 24-Hour Completely Offline Hackathon Team Size: 2–4 Members Competitive project evaluation and prizes ‍ Mentorship from faculty, industry professionals and experts Internship opportunities for winners and top-performing teams, subject to applicable arrangements Six domains: AI/ML, EdTech, Healthcare & Wellness, Agriculture & Sustainability, Travel & Smart Tourism, and Open Innovation Three-stage evaluation: Idea → Prototype → Final Presentation Certificates for eligible participants and winners Food, refreshments and participant welcome kits Industry interaction, networking and innovation opportunities Unique Spooky Halloween-themed hackathon experience Important Dates: Hackathon: 23–24 October 2026 Mode: Completely Offline Venue: Hi-Tech Institute of Engineering & Technology, Ghaziabad Registration Start: 22 August 2026 Registration End: 25 September 2026 Official Links: Email: hackathonhiet@gmail.com Innovate • Collaborate • Build • Win Dare to Code. Dare to Create.",
