ure &amp; Sustainability, Travel &amp; Smart Tourism, and Open Innovation</strong></li>\n<li>Three-stage evaluation: <strong data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1121\">Idea &rarr; Prototype &rarr; Final Presentation</strong></li>\n<li>Certificates for eligible participants and winners</li>\n<li>Food, refreshments and participant welcome kits</li>\n<li>Industry interaction, networking and innovation opportunities</li>\n<li>Unique <strong data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1337\">Spooky Halloween-themed</strong> hackathon experience</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"wlfuqn\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1382\"><strong>Important Dates:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1518\"><strong data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1398\">Hackathon:</strong> 23&ndash;24 October 2026</li>\n<li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1518\"><strong data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1429\">Mode:</strong> Completely Offline</li>\n<li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1518\"><strong data-start=\"1451\" data-end=\"1461\">Venue:</strong> Hi-Tech Institute of Engineering &amp; Technology, Ghaziabad</li>\n<li data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1633\"><strong data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1543\">Registration Start:</strong> <em data-start=\"1544\" data-end=\"1577\">22 August 2026</em></li>\n<li data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1633\"><strong data-start=\"1580\" data-end=\"1601\">Registration End:</strong>&nbsp;<em> 25 September 2026</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-section-id=\"ltcq0o\" data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1868\"><strong>Official Links:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"ltcq0o\" data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1868\"><strong data-start=\"1930\" data-end=\"1940\">Email:</strong> <a class=\"decorated-link\" href=\"mailto:hackathonhiet@gmail.com\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1964\">hackathonhiet@gmail.com</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2006\"><strong data-start=\"1966\" data-end=\"2006\">Innovate &bull; Collaborate &bull; Build &bull; Win</strong></p>\n<p